This implementation adapts the reference's component contracts, semantic theme
and application-owned parts architecture to ordinary borrowed GPUI views and
exclusively owned Signals. It does not incorporate the reference's Entity,
Rc/RefCell, procedural macro, asset, or global theme implementations.
